OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud and light rain initially
OL,6,Faround the coast, which clears early
OL,7,Fto mid-morning. Otherwise a day of
OL,8,Fsunny spells and a few isolated light
OL,9,Fshowers, most of these confined west
OL,10,Fof the A9.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers turning more frequent
OL,13,Fand heavier across western areas of
OL,14,FTayside and Central region during the
OL,15,Fevening, otherwise outbreaks isolated
OL,16,Fwith few reaching the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
